  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. Thread fish pieces onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "3. In a small bowl, whisk together chili flakes, garlic, ginger, brown sugar, fish sauce, and lime juice.",
    "4. Brush the skewers with peanut oil and sprinkle with chili flake mixture.",
    "5. Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes, or until cooked through.",
    "6. Garnish with chopped cilantro and serve immediately."
